{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3144","id":3399360669,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz887KniCd","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3144","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3144.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/3144.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3144","number":3144,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"mapper/batcher: serialize per-node work to prevent out-of-order delivery","user":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"processBatchedChanges queued each pending change for a node as a separate work item. Since multiple workers pull from the same channel, two changes for the same node could be processed concurrently by different workers. This caused out-of-order MapResponse delivery and a data race between updateSentPeers (Clear+Store) and computePeerDiff (Range) on the shared lastSentPeers map.\n\nThis change bundles all pending changes for a node into a single work item so one worker processes them sequentially. A per-node workMu mutex serializes processing across consecutive batch ticks, preventing a second worker from starting on the next tick's bundle while the current one is still in progress. Inter-node parallelism is preserved — different nodes are still processed concurrently by different workers.\n\nFixes #3140\n\nGenerated with the help of an AI assistant","created_at":"2026-03-14T16:11:08Z","updated_at":"2026-03-16T09:22:46Z","closed_at":"2026-03-16T09:22:46Z","merged_at":"2026-03-16T09:22:46Z","merge_commit_sha":"60317064fd493b974a54387fea29b282b00cf585","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3144/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/3144/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/3144/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/statuses/181987ca507d5eb8e961451ab7ae5b7e35694ce9","head":{"label":"kradalby:kradalby/3140-per-node-work","ref":"kradalby/3140-per-node-work","sha":"181987ca507d5eb8e961451ab7ae5b7e35694ce9","user":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/